<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Modern Landing Page</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
}

body{
    background:#f5f7fa;
    color:#333;
}

header{
    background:#0f172a;
    color:white;
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
}

nav{
    max-width:1200px;
    margin:auto;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    padding:20px;
}

.logo{
    font-size:28px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

nav ul{
    display:flex;
    list-style:none;
    gap:25px;
}

nav a{
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    transition:.3s;
}

nav a:hover{
    color:#38bdf8;
}

.hero{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    text-align:center;
    height:90vh;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2563eb,#7c3aed);
    color:white;
    padding:20px;
}

.hero-content{
    max-width:700px;
}

.hero h1{
    font-size:60px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.hero p{
    font-size:20px;
    line-height:1.6;
    margin-bottom:30px;
}

.btn{
    display:inline-block;
    padding:15px 35px;
    background:white;
    color:#2563eb;
    border-radius:30px;
    text-decoration:none;
    font-weight:bold;
    transition:.3s;
}

.btn:hover{
    transform:translateY(-4px);
}

section{
    padding:80px 20px;
}

.container{
    max-width:1200px;
    margin:auto;
}

.title{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:50px;
}

.title h2{
    font-size:40px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

.features{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
    gap:25px;
}

.card{
    background:white;
    padding:30px;
    border-radius:15px;
    text-align:center;
    box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
    transition:.3s;
}

.card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-8px);
}

.card h3{
    margin:20px 0;
}

.about{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:50px;
    align-items:center;
}

.about img{
    width:100%;
    border-radius:20px;
}

.contact{
    background:#0f172a;
    color:white;
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:40px;
}

form{
    display:grid;
    gap:20px;
}

input,textarea{
    padding:15px;
    border:none;
    border-radius:8px;
    font-size:16px;
}

button{
    padding:15px;
    background:#38bdf8;
    border:none;
    color:white;
    font-size:18px;
    border-radius:8px;
    cursor:pointer;
}

button:hover{
    background:#0ea5e9;
}

footer{
    background:#111827;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:25px;
    margin-top:60px;
}

@media(max-width:800px){

.hero h1{
    font-size:40px;
}

.about{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
}

nav{
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:15px;
}
}
</style>

</head>
<body>

<header>
<nav>
<div class="logo">MyWebsite</div>

<ul>
<li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
<li><a href="#features">Features</a></li>
<li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
<li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
</ul>

</nav>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="home">
<div class="hero-content">
<h1>Build Amazing Websites</h1>

<p>
Create beautiful, responsive websites with modern design,
fast performance, and an excellent user experience.
</p>

<a href="#features" class="btn">Get Started</a>

</div>
</section>

<section id="features">
<div class="container">

<div class="title">
<h2>Features</h2>
<p>Everything you need for a modern website.</p>
</div>

<div class="features">

<div class="card">
<h3>⚡ Fast</h3>
<p>Optimized for speed and performance.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>📱 Responsive</h3>
<p>Looks great on desktop, tablet, and mobile.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🎨 Beautiful Design</h3>
<p>Modern layout with smooth styling.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🔒 Secure</h3>
<p>Built with clean and organized code.</p>
</div>

</div>

</div>
</section>

<section id="about">
<div class="container about">

<div>
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498050108023-c5249f4df085?w=900" alt="Office">
</div>

<div>
<h2>About Us</h2>

<br>

<p>
We create modern digital experiences that combine
beautiful design with powerful technology.
Our goal is to help businesses and creators build
professional online experiences.
</p>

<br>

<a href="#" class="btn">Learn More</a>

</div>

</div>
</section>

<section id="contact">

<div class="container">

<div class="contact">

<h2>Contact Us</h2>

<br>

<form>

<input type="text" placeholder="Your Name">

<input type="email" placeholder="Email">

<textarea rows="6" placeholder="Your Message"></textarea>

<button type="submit">Send Message</button>

</form>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<footer>

<p>© 2026 MyWebsite. All Rights Reserved.</p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
